# Authentication Stability (Critical)

**Authentication stability outranks design changes.** If a UI feature conflicts with auth, preserve auth.

## Before ANY UI / styling / animation / component / route / dashboard work

1. Audit the existing auth architecture (do not change it unless explicitly requested).
2. Keep three layers isolated:
   - **Auth layer** — session, middleware, Supabase clients, callbacks, role checks
   - **Business logic** — server actions, data fetching, profile/brand queries
   - **Presentation** — components, layouts, styling, animations only

## Do NOT touch during UI work (unless user explicitly asks)

- `middleware.ts`
- `lib/supabase/middleware.ts`
- `lib/auth/actions.ts`, `lib/auth/session.ts`, `lib/auth/resolve-auth.ts`
- `lib/auth/fetch-profile.ts`, `lib/auth/ensure-profile.ts`, `lib/auth/cookies.ts`
- `lib/supabase/server.ts`, `lib/supabase/client.ts`, `lib/supabase/env.ts`
- `app/auth/callback/route.ts`
- Role checking in `lib/auth/paths.ts`, `lib/auth/profile.ts`

UI components may **consume** auth via existing APIs (`getUser`, `getProfile`, `requireClient`, etc.) — never reimplement auth inside UI files.

## Pre-change checklist (STOP if any fail)

- Login / logout / signup
- Admin login and Brand Owner login
- Dashboard and admin dashboard load
- Middleware passes; session + profile load
- Supabase connectivity; env vars present
- No redirect loops, hydration errors, infinite renders, or repeated profile queries

## Errors that must never appear

`fetch failed`, connection/unavailable auth messages, profile load failures, infinite loading, hydration mismatch, redirect/middleware loops, blank dashboard, session missing.

## Defensive handling

- Supabase failures → graceful fallback; never crash or block login indefinitely
- No infinite `useEffect` loops, repeated session/profile calls, or middleware loops
- Use existing `fetchWithTimeout`, `resolveUserFromGetUser`, and error humanization — do not bypass

## After every UI update

Run auth health check and report: login, signup, logout, admin login, brand owner login, session persistence, dashboard access, role routing, protected routes, Supabase connectivity.
